@HostAddress = http://localhost:5162
@HttpsAddress = https://localhost:7060

### 1. Lab 22: Login as Admin (Returns Access Token + Refresh Token)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

### 2. Lab 22: Login as Student (Role: Student)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "student",
  "password": "Student@123"
}

###

### 3. Lab 22: Access Protected Profile (Requires Bearer Token)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer <paste_token_here>
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Lab 24: Role-Based Authorization - Admin Only (Returns 403 Forbidden for Student)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/admin-only
Authorization: Bearer <paste_token_here>
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Lab 24: Role-Based Authorization - Academic Area (Allows Faculty & Student)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/faculty-student
Authorization: Bearer <paste_token_here>
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Lab 23: Refresh Token Rotation (Issues new Access Token & new Refresh Token)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessToken": "<paste_access_token_here>",
  "refreshToken": "<paste_refresh_token_here>"
}

###

### 7. Lab 23: Revoke / Logout (Invalidates Refresh Token)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <paste_token_here>
Accept: application/json

###
